are Pages docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/platform/changelog/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"developers.cloudflare.com","ref_id":"turn6search9","snippet":"Get this page as Markdown: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/index.md (append index.md) or send Accept: text/markdown to https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/. ...","title":"Configuration · Cloudflare Pages docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"developers.cloudflare.com","ref_id":"turn6search10","snippet":"Requests to your Functions are billed as Cloudflare Workers requests. ... The free plan daily request limit resets at midnight UTC.## On this page","title":"Pricing · Cloudflare Pages docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/functions/pricing/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"developers.cloudflare.com","ref_id":"turn6search11","snippet":"The following limits are imposed for build caching: ... If the project cache exceeds this limit, the project will automatically start deleting artifacts that were","title":"Build caching · Cloudflare Pages docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/build-caching/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"developers.cloudflare.com","ref_id":"turn6search12","snippet":"Checkpoint: A complete SASE architecture with Cloudflare ... more than 500 GitHub repositories, many of which allow IT teams to use and build","title":"REFERENCE ARCHITECTURE","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/reference-architecture/static/cloudflare-evolving-to-a-sase-architecture.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"developers.cloudflare.com","ref_id":"turn6search13","snippet":"The above diagram describes the connectivity model through Cloudflare Tunnel. ... Direct connection","title":"Multi-vendor Application Security and Performance","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/reference-architecture/static/multi-vendor-application-security-performance.pdf"}